{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202400","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220240001:1":{"text":"이... 이건... 이건 물인가요?\n이렇게 맑고, 아무런 냄새도 나지 않는 물이라니...","source_cn":"这……这是……这是，水吗？\\n这么清澈，一点味道都没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227919FDE98B93CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220240002:0":{"text":"너무 좋네요! 이 물은 얼마인가요? 제 돈으로는 부족하겠죠...?","source_cn":"这水太棒了！要多少钱呢？我的钱不够吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5A8E5F3EA675049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220240003:1":{"text":"하하하하! 걱정 마, 이 물은 비싸지 않아! 이건 다 바닷물을 여과한 거라 얼마든지 있거든!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！放心吧，这水不贵！都是海水过滤的，要多少有多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088537EB90449EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220240004:1":{"text":"망설일 필요 없어. 쓰고 싶으면 써! 앞으로 이 물은 얼마든지 써도 돼!","source_cn":"别磨蹭了，想用就用吧！以后这些水想怎么用就怎么用！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x681EEAF6238D424C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220240005:0":{"text":"...저, 저, 정말 감사합니다! 정말 고마워요! 흑흑흑...","source_cn":"……太、太、太感谢您了！太感谢您了！呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3A1F7266D4D5D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220240006:0":{"text":"이봐, 맘대로 달려들지 마! 내 옷이 눈물에 다 더러워지잖아!","source_cn":"喂！别扑过来！我的衣服都被你哭脏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71EC86F8006A209D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220240007:0":{"text":"이봐, 멀린. 보고만 있지 말고 날 좀 도와줘!","source_cn":"喂！梅林，别干看着，帮帮我啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9F24467F203D7A9D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이봐, 멀린. 보고만 있지 말고 날 좀 도와줘!","female":"이봐, 멀린. 보고만 있지 말고 날 좀 도와줘!","variant_male_record_index":"134984","variant_female_record_index":"134985","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220240008:1":{"text":"후긴 씨는 참 다정하네요. 입이 험해서 그렇지.","source_cn":"呼金真是体贴啊，就是嘴和铁砧一样硬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD813E87A8AF51822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220240009:0":{"text":"죄, 죄송해요. 제가 실례를 했네요...\n하지만, 정말 너무 감사해요!","source_cn":"抱、抱歉，我太失态了……\\n但是，真的太感谢您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29372E5DE00B52F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220240010:0":{"text":"사실, 지난번 데이트에서 저랑 파티흐는 약혼했어요. 파티흐가 다음에 자기가 돌아오면 결혼식을 하자고 했죠...","source_cn":"其实，上次的约会，我和法迪订婚了。法迪跟我说，下次他回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x974FAAB6A70A16E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220240011:1":{"text":"전 줄곧 그날 제대로 꾸며야겠다고 생각하고 있었어요. 적어도 너무 고약한 냄새가 나지 않도록...","source_cn":"我一直想在那天打扮得体面一些，至少不要太难闻……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ADE7B498CCF341A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220240012:1":{"text":"저도 알아요. 전에 썼던 그런 물로는 아무리 씻어도 비린내가 남는다는 걸요.","source_cn":"我也清楚，用以前那种水，不管怎么洗，身上都会有腥味的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D959F4F198E405D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220240013:1":{"text":"그런데 지금 이 물은... 깨끗이 씻을 수 있을 뿐 아니라 마실 수도 있다고 생각하니... 흑흑흑...","source_cn":"但，没想到，现在这些水……不光可以好好洗漱，还能用来喝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C12D5131A2A1227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220240014:1":{"text":"아그니 양은 분명 러스트 항에서 가장 아름다운 신부가 될 거예요!","source_cn":"安格妮小姐一定会是全锈锚港最漂亮的新娘子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D654BEE0A8ABB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220240015:1":{"text":"네, 맞아요. 고마워요, 서머너 양! 전 분명 가장 아름다운 신부가 될 거예요...","source_cn":"是、是的，谢谢你，使魔小姐！我一定会成为最漂亮的新娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4164ABB3688434","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220240016:1":{"text":"이게 다 당신 덕분이에요. 고마워요, 드워프 선생님, 당신은 전 세계에서 가장 위대한 장인이에요!","source_cn":"这都是多亏了您，谢谢您，矮人师傅，您真是全世界最最伟大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82870A6EDF5DBAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1220240017:1":{"text":"제 결혼식 청첩장을 꼭 보낼게요!","source_cn":"我结婚的时候，一定会给您发请柬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2F722EAED79F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1220240018:1":{"text":"와하하하! 좋아! 내 꼭 참석하도록 하지!","source_cn":"哇哈哈哈哈！好啊！我到时候一定会去的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CCD3E440A3A43DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:安格妮":{"text":"아그니","source":"安格妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}